[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ericlmao/hawkeye/main/assets/banner.png[/IMG]
[B]Hawkeye[/B] records what happens on your server (blocks, containers, entities, chat and commands) and lets your staff look it up, inspect it and roll it back, on one server or across a whole network.
It is a ground-up alternative to CoreProtect. Your staff keep the lookup parameters they already know, your CoreProtect history comes over with one command, and months of logs take megabytes instead of gigabytes.
[TABLE]
[TR][TH]Quick Links[/TH][TH][/TH][/TR]
